  "title": "AECOM appoints David Rottblatt to lead strategic growth across private-sector aviation markets",
  "summary": "DALLAS (June 12, 2026) — AECOM, the trusted global infrastructure leader, today announced its appointment of David Rottblatt as Senior Vice President, Director of Strategic Private sector client growth in the Aviation Market Sector. Based out of California, Mr. Rottblatt will be responsible for expanding AECOM’s presence across private sector aviation clients and emerging aviation markets, while strengthening alignment with core commercial airport clients. “We are pleased to welcome David to AECOM,” said Dwight Pullen,...",
